flowchart TD
  Sched[Scheduler_by_Risk_Interval] --> Due[Mark_REFRESH_DUE]
  Due --> Notify[Notify_Customer]
  Notify --> Update[Customer_Updates_Profile]
  Update --> Screen[ReScreen_Sanctions_PEP]
  Screen --> Risk[ReScore_CRP]
  Risk --> Mat{Material_Change_or_HighRisk}
  Mat -->|yes| EDD[EDD_or_Manual]
  Mat -->|no| Done[Complete_Refresh_Set_Next_Due]
  EDD --> Done
  Due --> Overdue{Overdue_Policy}
  Overdue -->|yes| Restrict[Restrict_Debit_or_Freeze]
  Restrict --> Notify
